  -
    id: nav-content-shell
    title: Nav and content shell
    intentAliases: shell, app shell, navigation, layout, nav content
    notes: Page chrome around a content master. Optional page action.
    slots:
      - role: header | status: unbound | nextRecommend: header nav title
      - role: content | required: true | status: unbound | nextRecommend: card
      - role: primary-cta | status: filled | master: (name: Button, figmaNodeId: 30:10, fileKey: ACMEUI)
  -
    id: search-results
    title: Search results
    intentAliases: search results, search results list, results list, search page
    notes: Search bar, a results list, and an empty / no-results state.
    slots:
      - role: search | required: true | status: filled | master: (name: Text field, figmaNodeId: 30:20, fileKey: ACMEUI)
      - role: results | required: true | status: unbound | nextRecommend: list row
      - role: empty | status: unbound | nextRecommend: empty message
  -
    id: settings-form
    title: Settings form
    intentAliases: settings, preferences, account form, profile form
    notes: Labeled fields with a save action. Bind defaultMasterId after ingest if your Input/Button ids are stable.
    slots:
      - role: input | required: true | status: filled | master: (name: Text field, figmaNodeId: 30:20, fileKey: ACMEUI)
      - role: primary-cta | required: true | status: filled | master: (name: Button, figmaNodeId: 30:10, fileKey: ACMEUI)
  -
    id: sign-in
    title: Sign in
    intentAliases: sign in, login, log in, auth, authenticate
    notes: Identifier and secret fields plus submit. Same Input master may fill both field slots.
    slots:
